These three models are Google's MediaPipe hand models, converted to ONNX for the PS VR2 driver's hand tracking:

  hand_landmarks_detector.onnx    from hand_landmarker.task (MediaPipe Hand Landmarker)
  gesture_embedder.onnx           from gesture_recognizer.task (MediaPipe Gesture Recognizer)
  canned_gesture_classifier.onnx  from gesture_recognizer.task (MediaPipe Gesture Recognizer)

Original models: https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/latest/hand_landmarker.task
and https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/gesture_recognizer/gesture_recognizer/float16/latest/gesture_recognizer.task
